  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:360px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-lightblue pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Remote Absorbing Replication</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/4/4e/Mobile_-_Marvel_Battle_Lines_-_Absorbing_Man_Carl_Creel.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20191111041658\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Mobile - Marvel Battle Lines - Absorbing Man Carl Creel\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/4/4e/Mobile_-_Marvel_Battle_Lines_-_Absorbing_Man_Carl_Creel.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20191111041658\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/4/4e/Mobile_-_Marvel_Battle_Lines_-_Absorbing_Man_Carl_Creel.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20191111041658 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/4/4e/Mobile_-_Marvel_Battle_Lines_-_Absorbing_Man_Carl_Creel.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20191111041658 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Mobile - Marvel Battle Lines - Absorbing Man Carl Creel\" width=\"270\" height=\"270\" data-image-key=\"Mobile_-_Marvel_Battle_Lines_-_Absorbing_Man_Carl_Creel.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Mobile - Marvel Battle Lines - Absorbing Man Carl Creel.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Absorbing Man (Marvel Comics) once flexed the limits of his abilities learning he could mimic and control things even from a prison cell.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Absorb and replicate anything from a distance.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>assimilate anything from a distance.</b> Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Absorbing_Replication\" title=\"Absorbing Replication\">Absorbing Replication</a>. Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Decodification\" title=\"Decodification\">Decodification</a>. Technique of <a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Adaptation_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Adaptation Manipulation\">Bio-Adaptation Manipulation</a>. Opposite to <a href=\"/wiki/Tactile_Absorbing_Replication\" title=\"Tactile Absorbing Replication\">Tactile Absorbing Replication</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Techniques\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Techniques</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FRemote_Absorbing_Replication%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Assimilation from a Distance</li>\n<li>Ranged Omni-Morph Duplication</li>\n<li>Ultimate Commandant</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FRemote_Absorbing_Replication%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A user can emulate anything, anyone and all their unique features by focusing on them from a distance. Taking such properties this way, in no shape or form, doesn't diminishes the utilization value of such a form of replication. Point of fact, it can be a strength as a wielder can essentially add additional properties and other elements to it along the way while said initial absorption travels great distances in order to get to them. \n</p><p>They can even distantly encode as well as transplant multiple aspects, abstracts and/or elements all at once. They can even withhold them in faraway storage centers for later use. \n</p><p>Said power makes for an excellent tool in subterfuge as it is also a viable means of very effective stealth and misdirection, being able to be used for snatching, replacement, implanting and deportation of anything one focuses on. Physical baubles and items of monetary import to be certain; as well as memories, thought processes, powers and abilities, secrets of any kind, etc. This culminates in the withholding of such fine items upon one's own person like a walking storage center or inputting it upon other facilities they can withdraw and deposit to most anything they wish too at a different time and date.\n</p><p>Ultimately, this power allows one to capably operate absorption abilities from a distance.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FRemote_Absorbing_Replication%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorbing_Replication\" title=\"Absorbing Replication\">Absorbing Replication</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorptive_Entity_Access\" title=\"Absorptive Entity Access\">Absorptive Entity Access</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Selective_Unity\" title=\"Selective Unity\">Selective Unity</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Total_Mimicry\" title=\"Total Mimicry\">Total Mimicry</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Transformation_Mimicry\" title=\"Transformation Mimicry\">Transformation Mimicry</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Battle_Shifting\" title=\"Battle Shifting\">Battle Shifting</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Adaptive_Augmentation\" title=\"Adaptive Augmentation\">Adaptive Augmentation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Capture_System\" title=\"Capture System\">Capture System</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Army\" title=\"Personal Army\">Personal Army</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Effect_Manipulation\" title=\"Effect Manipulation\">Effect Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Functionality_Manipulation\" title=\"Functionality Manipulation\">Functionality Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Meta-Possession\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Meta-Possession\">Meta-Possession</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Adaptive_Possession\" title=\"Adaptive Possession\">Adaptive Possession</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Possessive_Enhancement\" title=\"Possessive Enhancement\">Possessive Enhancement</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Multi_Hive_Mind\" title=\"Multi Hive Mind\">Multi Hive Mind</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Empathic_Conversion\" title=\"Empathic Conversion\">Empathic Conversion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Reality_Mind\" title=\"Reality Mind\">Reality Mind</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Remote_Possession\" title=\"Remote Possession\">Remote Possession</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Multi_Possession\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Multi Possession\">Multi Possession</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Modification\" ti